{"nodes": [{"id": "laporan_laporan", "label": "LAPORAN.md \u2014 Perpustakaan Web (Frontend) Work Report", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "laporan_perpustakaan_web", "label": "Perpustakaan Web Frontend (React + Vite + Tailwind v4)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "header", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Front end of a library system, rebuilt from an empty template into an interactive bookshelf landing page plus a login flow wired to the Go backend."}, {"id": "laporan_perpustakaan_api", "label": "Perpustakaan API Backend (Go, port 8080)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "header", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "laporan_project_cleanup", "label": "Initial Project Cleanup of Malformed src Directories", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a72 Pembersihan Awal", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deliberate first step before any page work: remove `src\\017mponents` (a folder whose name contained a 0x0F control byte) and the `srcpages` typo folder, then empty the already-blank `src/components` and `src/pages` so the tree could be rebuilt cleanly."}, {"id": "laporan_final_file_structure", "label": "Final src/ File Structure", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a73 Struktur File Final", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each file is tagged (B) dibuat baru / (M) dimodifikasi / (T) tidak berubah so the report can state exactly how much of the Vite template survived."}, {"id": "laporan_axios_client", "label": "src/api/client.js \u2014 Axios Instance with Bearer Token Interceptor", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a74 src/api/client.js", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A single shared Axios instance carries baseURL http://localhost:8080 and a request interceptor that injects `Authorization: Bearer <token>` from localStorage, so authenticated endpoints such as admin reset-password need no per-call token plumbing."}, {"id": "laporan_auth_session_helper", "label": "src/utils/auth.js \u2014 Token/Session Helper (set, get, clear)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a73 Struktur File Final", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Session persistence is funnelled through one helper (set/get/clear of token and user) instead of scattered localStorage calls, which is what makes the route guards cheap."}, {"id": "laporan_login_flow", "label": "Login Flow (POST /login \u2192 localStorage token+user \u2192 /dashboard)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a74 Alur Login", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The report states explicitly that this flow never changed across any of the eleven UI iterations \u2014 only the surrounding design moved, so the auth behaviour was treated as a fixed contract."}, {"id": "laporan_api_endpoint_map", "label": "Backend Endpoint Integration Map", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a74 Halaman & Integrasi Backend", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each of the four endpoints is pinned to exactly one page (or two), with its request schema, response shape and auth requirement, so the frontend's coupling to the backend is explicit and reviewable."}, {"id": "laporan_buku_model", "label": "Buku Model (id_buku, judul, penulis, deskripsi, gambar, stok)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a74 endpoint table, GET /buku", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "laporan_routing_guards", "label": "App.jsx Routing and Route Guards", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a75 Routing (App.jsx)", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every path is enumerated with a wildcard fallback that navigates to \"/\"; guards wrap only the pages that need identity."}, {"id": "laporan_protected_guard", "label": "Protected Route Guard (redirect to / when no token)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a75 Guard diimplementasikan", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "laporan_requireadmin_guard", "label": "RequireAdmin Route Guard (id_role === 1)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a75 Guard diimplementasikan", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Non-admins are redirected to /dashboard rather than bounced to \"/\", so a signed-in user who follows an admin link lands somewhere useful instead of being logged out visually."}, {"id": "laporan_design_iteration_history", "label": "UI Design Iteration History (11 Rounds)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a76 Iterasi Desain yang Dilalui", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The table records rejected as well as accepted directions with the reason attached, so the final look is a documented outcome of iteration rather than a first guess."}, {"id": "laporan_anti_ai_slop_rejection", "label": "Rejection of Neon / AI-Generic UI Concepts", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a76 rows 1, 4, 8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three directions were killed on taste grounds rather than technical ones: the split-screen gradient + glassmorphism login was judged 'neon/AI slop', the dot-grid + 'Buku Paling Dipinjam' preview card was judged a 'widget AI dump', and the bookshelf landing + login modal was dropped because it turned out to be a modal, not the intent."}, {"id": "laporan_minimal_single_card", "label": "Minimal Single-Card Design Direction", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a76 rows 2, 5, 6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The direction that survived: one `max-w-md` card on a flat light ground, Linear/Vercel-style (bg-slate-100 card, bg-slate-900 button), later refined with a `border-t-zinc-900` accent border over a gradient."}, {"id": "laporan_landing_two_tier_bookshelf", "label": "Landing.jsx \u2014 2-Tier Interactive Bookshelf", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a77 Landing.jsx", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Final landing design (iteration 11): cream `bg-[#F3EFE6]` field, two thick wooden shelves (`bg-gradient from-[#A67C52] to-[#8B5A2B]`, h-5, highlight + shadow), 22 books per row for 44 total drawn from GET /buku and padded with dummy data, textless books in a retro/earth-tone palette, height 120\u2013255px, thickness 14\u201334px, some rotated \u00b13\u20136deg, one horizontal stack per 8 books, hover lift with `-translate-y` and 3D shadow, a white serif pill badge (bg-white/95 backdrop-blur) reading the title and 'Klik untuk Pinjam', and a `blur-2xl` glow behind the shelves for depth."}, {"id": "laporan_book_click_to_login", "label": "Book Click \u2192 /login with bookTitle / bookColor Route State", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a77 Landing.jsx, \u00a77 Login.jsx", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Clicking a spine navigates with `navigate('/login', {state: {bookTitle, bookColor}})` so the login hero can render the exact book that was clicked; the modal variant was rejected precisely because a separate modal broke this handoff."}, {"id": "laporan_landing_dummy_book_fallback", "label": "Landing Dummy Book List Fallback", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a77 Landing.jsx", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dummy books fill the shelves and stand in entirely when the backend is down, so the landing page never renders as an empty grey grid during local development."}, {"id": "laporan_login_hero_page", "label": "Login.jsx \u2014 Hero Login Split Layout", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a77 Login.jsx", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Left column carries a small 'Perpustakaan' badge, the headline 'Buku impianmu, tinggal satu klik lagi.' and a large hero book rendered in the clicked book's colour (tilted, shadowed); the right column is the plain form card (Username, Password, `Masuk` button bg-slate-900). Defaults are 'Laskar Pelangi' plus a hashed colour when no state arrives."}, {"id": "laporan_dashboard_catalog", "label": "Dashboard.jsx \u2014 Book Catalog with Search", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a77 Dashboard.jsx", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Navbar + welcome hero + search toolbar over a card grid of GET /buku results, cover images served from `/uploads/` (prefixed with the backend origin) and a stock badge on each card."}, {"id": "laporan_dashboard_lint_fix", "label": "Dashboard Fetch Deferral for react-hooks/set-state-in-effect", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a77 Dashboard.jsx fixes", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "`loading` initialised to `false`, a `fetched` flag added, and the fetch deferred with `setTimeout(0)` \u2014 done specifically to satisfy the `react-hooks/set-state-in-effect` lint rule, not to change behaviour."}, {"id": "laporan_register_page", "label": "Register.jsx \u2014 Registration Form", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a74, \u00a77", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "POST /register with body {username, password} returning only a {message}; only an unused `navigate` variable was removed during linting, the function itself is unchanged."}, {"id": "laporan_admin_reset_password_page", "label": "AdminResetPassword.jsx \u2014 Admin Password Reset (PUT)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a74, \u00a77", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The one endpoint in the app requiring both Bearer auth and the Admin role; body {username, new_password}, reached only through the RequireAdmin guard."}, {"id": "laporan_unauthenticated_buku_access", "label": "GET /buku Requires No Authentication (Open Risk)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a79 item 3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Because the backend exposes GET /buku without auth, Landing and Dashboard fetch it tokenless; the report flags that the Dashboard route is still login-guarded even though the data it reads is not."}, {"id": "laporan_build_lint_verification", "label": "Build and Lint Verification (Vite 8, 1904 modules)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a78 Build & Lint", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Final gate before hand-off: `npm run build` green (Vite 8, 1904 modules, ~310 kB JS bundle / ~100 kB gzip) and `npm run lint` clean with 0 errors and 0 warnings."}, {"id": "laporan_open_risks", "label": "Open Items and Risks", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a79 Hal yang Masih Terbuka / Risk", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A deliberately unresolved list rather than a clean bill of health: five items the author could not close within the session."}, {"id": "laporan_bukutab_deletion_risk", "label": "BukuTab.jsx Deleted Outside This Session", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a72 note, \u00a79 item 1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "`src/components/BukuTab.jsx` shows as ` D` in git status although the author never touched it and `src/components` was already empty at session start; left unclaimed rather than silently reverted, pending confirmation it is not residue of an older commit."}, {"id": "laporan_template_css_residue", "label": "index.css Leftover Sliding-Overlay Template CSS", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a79 item 2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dead *sliding overlay* classes from the original Vite template are still in index.css; judged safe to delete but left in place because they do not affect runtime."}, {"id": "laporan_frontend_scope_boundary", "label": "Backend .env / JWT Secret Out of Report Scope", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a79 item 5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "JWT secrets live in the sibling `perpustakaan-api` project; the report explicitly excludes them so no secret material is claimed as frontend scope."}], "edges": [{"source": "laporan_laporan", "target": "laporan_perpustakaan_web", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "header", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "laporan_laporan", "target": "laporan_perpustakaan_api", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "header", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "laporan_laporan", "target": "laporan_project_cleanup", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a72", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "laporan_laporan", "target": "laporan_final_file_structure", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a73", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "laporan_laporan", "target": "laporan_api_endpoint_map", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a74", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "laporan_laporan", "target": "laporan_login_flow", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a74 Alur Login", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "laporan_laporan", "target": "laporan_routing_guards", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a75", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "laporan_laporan", "target": "laporan_design_iteration_history", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "LAPORAN.md", "source_location": "\u00a76", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "laporan_laporan", "target": "laporan_build_lint_verification", "relation"